{"availability":"available","full":"crisp-oss/chappe","name":"chappe","description":"Developer Docs builder. Write guides in Markdown and references in API Blueprint. Comes with a built-in search engine.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":238,"forks":31,"created":"2022-01-03T08:42:41Z","updated":"2026-05-03T18:30:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/chappe","topics":["api-documentation","api-rest","blueprint","cloudflare-pages","developer","developer-documentation","developer-tool","docs","docs-generator","documentation","documentation-tool","github-pages","markdown"],"demo":"https://docs.crisp.chat/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:49.758Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:49.758Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:49.758Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T07:21:49.758Z","stars":238,"forks":31}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Developer Docs builder. Write guides in Markdown and references in API Blueprint. Comes with a built-in search engine.","Chappe is a Developer Docs builder, that produces static assets. No runtime, just lightweight static files. It was built to address SaaS companies needs, and can serve as a first-class modern alternative to hosted services such as ReadMe.","The reason behind why we made Chappe is the following: while looking for a Developer Docs builder at Crisp, all that we could find were either outdated open-source projects, or commercial documentation builders. We wanted a modern Developer Docs website hosted on our premises, as pure-static assets. The latter is especially important, as we do not want to rely on a plethora of external services that can go down anytime."],"features":["Writing all your docs in Markdown;","Building your docs in a single command;","Finally, deploying static build assets to your Web servers (or GitHub Pages, Cloudflare Pages, etc. — this can be automated via GitHub Actions);","Simple & fast: generate a Developer Docs with optimized static assets. No runtime","Guides: write developer guides in Markdown (rich content support: images, videos, tables, etc.)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/crisp-oss/chappe/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"a277cb6e382347dc0ccfd4d56e200f33136812ea69833bd624d209fd2c498b9d","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:49.925Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:49.925Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Developer Docs builder. Write guides in Markdown and references in API Blueprint. Comes with a built-in search engine.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/crisp-oss/chappe/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a277cb6e382347dc0ccfd4d56e200f33136812ea69833bd624d209fd2c498b9d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/crisp-oss/chappe/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:49.926Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-05-03T18:30:57Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/crisp-oss/chappe/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:49.929Z","hash":"a277cb6e382347dc0ccfd4d56e200f33136812ea69833bd624d209fd2c498b9d","originalBytes":25305,"storedBytes":25305,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["chappe","docs","markdown","api","example","file","build","guides","reference","references","data","change","config.json","configuration","guide","rest","title","assets","default","eg.","json","server","value","which","write","blueprint","code","developer","following","changes","crisp","how","syntax","available","examples","name","navigation","search","updated","used","dist","github","images","inline","link","local","need","open","stored","text","acme-docs","chatbox","date","each","full","host","install","make","note","page","pages","property","serve","type","url","within","defined","development","either","folder","found","http","instance","npx","section","sections","such","support","sure","urls","web","when","while","writing","add"